REF CMD V2: ssh alpine@10.10.0.15 'iperf3 -c 10.10.0.1 -p 5205 -t 10 -b 9G -J' (both together, 2 runs)
vfrot: feedback = WORST victim, min over V1/V2 of EMA(1 s rate)/own reference < thresh; budget start 10000, clamp [800, 16000] Mbit/s, rotation over 4 holders (holder gets B - (n_active - 1) x 200); static/lqr never see the victims
